  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-sar-landslide-detection.\n\n- Detects and extracts suspected landslide polygons by fusing InSAR deformation rates, SAR backscatter change, and DEM-derived slope.\n- Dual-threshold and score-based method with connected component analysis, morphological cleaning, and risk level assignment.\n- Supports both real and synthetic data modes; all processing is fully offline.\n- Outputs GeoJSON landslide polygons, deformation/risk GeoTIFFs, risk summary JSON, and manifest.\n- Includes robust normalization options and flexible CLI usage.\n- Documentation provided in both English and Chinese.",
